sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AN as Annotation tool
    participant ROI as roi-db
    participant LT as labeltree-db API

    Note over AN,LT: Annotation time
    AN->>LT: GET /trees/taxonomy/search?q=chaeto
    LT-->>AN: [nodes…] + X-Tree-Revision: 42
    AN->>ROI: label roi 9001 = node 431
    ROI->>ROI: store (tree=taxonomy, node_id=431, rev=42)

    Note over ROI,LT: Months later
    ROI->>LT: GET /trees/taxonomy
    LT-->>ROI: latest rev = 57 (changed → refresh)
    ROI->>LT: GET /nodes/431
    LT-->>ROI: deprecation record: deprecated_in_rev: 50, successors: [1301, 1302]
    ROI->>LT: GET /nodes/1301, /nodes/1302
    LT-->>ROI: successor nodes (still in the tree)
    ROI->>ROI: downstream decides: flag for re-annotation,<br/>display old label, etc.

    Note over ROI,LT: Reproducing history
    ROI->>LT: GET /nodes/431/ancestors?rev=42
    LT-->>ROI: path as it was at rev 42 (immutable, cacheable)
